{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"relation\": \"正在面对\",\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S13-1\",\n      \"text\": \"刚才的幸福让他真切感到自己有多喜欢对方，没法再把对方会不会选择自己当成无所谓。\",\n      \"key\": \"有多喜欢对方\",\n      \"follows\": false,\n      \"explains\": [\"B1\", \"B2\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S13-2\",\n      \"text\": \"他不愿逼对方回应，也不想让对方替自己消除所有不安。\",\n      \"key\": \"不愿逼对方回应\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B3\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S13-3\",\n      \"text\": \"把喜欢留在心里时，他曾安心些，还是想靠近。后来尽情喜欢，他也快乐过，却仍没把握对方会不会选择自己。\",\n      \"key\": \"还是想靠近\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B1\", \"B2\", \"B3\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S13-4\",\n      \"text\": \"他仍急着想靠近，也不愿因怕落空就少喜欢一点。两边都放不下，他难受，却不愿假装自己不在乎。\",\n      \"key\": \"少喜欢一点\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B2\", \"B3\"]\n    }\n  ],\n  \"because\": [\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S12-3\",\n      \"to\": \"S13-1\",\n      \"rel\": \"唤起\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S12-5\",\n      \"to\": \"S13-1\",\n      \"rel\": \"提供理由\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S09-2\",\n      \"to\": \"S13-2\",\n      \"rel\": \"限制\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S07-2\",\n      \"to\": \"S13-3\",\n      \"rel\": \"提供理由\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S07-4\",\n      \"to\": \"S13-3\",\n      \"rel\": \"说明\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S11-4\",\n      \"to\": \"S13-3\",\n      \"rel\": \"说明\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S10-1\",\n      \"to\": \"S13-4\",\n      \"rel\": \"仍在起作用\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"changes\": [\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R57\", \"R59\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S13-1\"],\n      \"what\": \"合并并改写\",\n      \"why\": \"把没有着落的愿望具体写成在意对方会不会选择自己，并写明刚才的幸福让他真切感到自己爱得多深，因此无法再把回应当成无所谓。用S12-5支撑愿望仍未得到保证，不再依赖S12-4单独解释愿望为何重新显现。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R60\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S13-2\", \"S13-4\"],\n      \"what\": \"拆分保留\",\n      \"why\": \"S13-2保留不逼对方回应、不让对方负责消除不安的边界；S13-4保留不愿因害怕落空而削弱喜欢的选择，避免重复宣告两边的冲突。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R58\", \"R61\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S13-1\", \"S13-3\"],\n      \"what\": \"合并并具体化\",\n      \"why\": \"不再抽象总结深情不能换来选择，而是写他把喜欢留在心里时曾安心却仍想靠近，后来尽情喜欢也快乐过，却仍没把握对方会不会选择自己。删除S04-3的弱箭头，改用S07-2、S07-4和S11-4支撑真实经历。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R62\", \"R63\", \"R64\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S13-4\"],\n      \"what\": \"合并并改写\",\n      \"why\": \"保留想靠近的迫切、不愿逼迫对方、两边都放不下所以难受，以及不愿假装自己不在乎。删去重复的冲突总结，并移除S12-3对害怕失望这一心理的弱支撑。\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"gaps\": []\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "0b7b1bca-ef5c-4a0a-a8b9-15c51b583b05", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261029T114341381148Z", "elapsed_seconds": 685.937, "completed_utc": "2026-10-29T11:55:07.330582+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "d45b55f02cb8733666958f76a1a33734f330d296040396c12f1074b77fdf232f", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "5968886fe255f06b948842c8a649fd0127f8ddec9fc4958701d80251c394b449", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py"